    "TitleKey": "Battaglia_RPT_ScanMine_06_title",
    "Description": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Mining and Data Collection\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nHave a big one for you today. Need you to get down there and mine ~mission(Resources) ~mission(MineableType)</EM4> and relay your stats back to us. I'm looking to pull together some findings from various miners around the system. ~mission(Rarity)\n\nAlso, if you're stuck of where to look or new to mining, <EM4>the United Resource Workers wrote a helpful journal that you should check out. It's in your mobi.</EM4>\n\nLet me know if you\u2019re up for it.\n\nPAYMENT:\nStandard listed rate upon full area scan confirmation and extraction.\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
    "DescriptionKey": "Battaglia_RPT_ScanMine_06_desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Mining and Data Collection\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nHave a big one for you today. Need you to get down there and mine [AmountToScan] of Savrillium and [AmountToScan2] of Lindinium Asteroid</EM4> and relay your stats back to us. I'm looking to pull together some findings from various miners around the system. These are pretty rare resources, so they might be tricky to find.\n\nAlso, if you're stuck of where to look or new to mining, <EM4>the United Resource Workers wrote a helpful journal that you should check out. It's in your mobi.</EM4>\n\nLet me know if you\u2019re up for it.\n\nPAYMENT:\nStandard listed rate upon full area scan confirmation and extraction.\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
